; The F to Belling-Lee adaptor (RetroXR-models generic/f-to-iec-adapter): its Belling-Lee male in a
; PAL set's aerial socket, an F-type lead into its far end. One plug, no cord (an AvAdapter).
; Origin: the IEC male's stop face, +Z the male. Round, so turned about X as a phono plug is.
[node name="FToIecAdapter" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_script")
cord_colors = PackedColorArray(0.086, 0.086, 0.094, 1)

