; The F-type female an aerial's lead or an RF switch's pigtail goes into: an adapter jack
; (AdapterCoaxPort) that belongs to the set the adapter is in, direction IN, on the aerial
; input (TvPanel.input_of_port, aerial()). Its zone stands at the model's FMouth, +Z out
; of the mouth. The phono jack the port scene wears is hidden: the model draws the F thread.
[node name="FJack" parent="PlugA0" instance=ExtResource("6_rcaport")]
transform = Transform3D(-1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, -1, 0, 0, -0.022)
script = ExtResource("7_jackscript")
direction = 1
show_jack = false
